msoft-float
Target Mask(SOFT_FLOAT)
Generate code with floating point emulation.

menvironment=
Target RejectNegative Joined Enum(brew_environment) Var(brew_environment) Init(0)
-menvironment=[user|operating]	Link for the given run-time environment: user (TASK mode, syscalls provided by the simulator or an OS; the default) or operating (bare metal, started from reset in SCHEDULER mode).

Enum
Name(brew_environment) Type(int)
Known run-time environments (for use with the -menvironment= option):

EnumValue
Enum(brew_environment) String(user) Value(0)

EnumValue
Enum(brew_environment) String(operating) Value(1)

mno-crt0
Target RejectNegative
Do not link the run-time environment's startup file (crt0.o).
